 chips brand.\n\nThe video begins with clear packaging and product, carefully created 3D-rendered angles, for close-ups, highlighting design, texture, and crisp detail to help shoppers instantly recognize what they’re buying.\n\nIt then transitions into real-life usage moments, showing actors enjoying the chips, reinforcing taste appeal and everyday snacking occasions.\n\nThe structure follows marketplace best practices:\n* Clear packaging visibility\n* Detailed product texture shots\n* Real consumption moments\n* Simple, benefit-led messaging\n\nEvery product model, environment, animation, and character is produced using our unique proprietary CGI, VFX & AI production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers, enabling brands to create high-end eCom videos without studios, cameras, or live production. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise semi-3D model (2 angles of the product) of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, ensuring premium quality and marketplace-ready output designed to drive conversions and add-to-cart.\n\nWe create e-commerce listing videos that follow proven marketplace guidelines, showing the product within the first 3 seconds, delivering a strong visual hook, clear benefits, and real-life usage across multiple settings. Clean, platform-optimized visuals are designed for Amazon, Flipkart, Shopify, and D2C websites to drive higher add-to-cart and conversions. Shopify reports up to 28 percent higher sales for products showcased clearly on video, while Meta and Amazon emphasize benefit-led visuals for stronger purchase intent.\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, d